There is no new equity, and the revolvers stay undrawn. I will bring no dividend or buyback proposal before the 2036-37 peak is past and we are solidly investment grade. I also put Malave's point to the Board for its decision: retaining 2035-39 surplus would build a stress cushion of about $17.5B through the peak. The path will be reported every round.

